{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56501","headline":"下座咏 · 朱君绪","name":"下座咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙品演布化，迢迢霄玄音。\n等受无碍智，三梁度黄津。\n神霄功曹使，疲劳小停神。\n三会因劳赏，当报不负言。\n须啓更当白，便曹未恚悬。\n下座服居位，礼拜三宝尊。\n（《要修科仪戒律钞》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱君绪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}